     4	(1) Usage: python scripts/pre_analysis.py COMMAND [ARGS]...
     5	
     6	╭─ Commands ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
     7	│ plot-corr                   (RQ1) Generate plots for Correlations between cuf Features and Defect-inducing Risks              │
     8	│ plot-hmap                   Generate plots for Collinearity between Features                                                  │
     9	│ table-distribution          Tabulate the distribution of the dataset                                                          │
    10	│ table-group-diff            (RQ1) Tabulate the group differences between buggy and clean commits for cuf                      │
    11	│ table-group-diff-projects   Tabulate the group differences between buggy and clean commits for cuf (each project)             │
    12	╰───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
    13	
    14	(2) Usage: python scripts/jit_sdp.py COMMAND [ARGS]...
    15	
    16	Experiments for Just-In-Time Software Defect Prediction (JIT-SDP)
    17	
    18	╭─ Commands ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
    19	│ actionable   Compute the ratios of actionable features for the baseline and combined models for the true positive samples in  │
    20	│              the 20 folds JIT-SDP                                                                                             │
    21	│ train-test   Train and test the baseline/cuf/combined model with 20 folds JIT-SDP                                             │
    22	╰───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
    23	
    24	(3) Usage: python scripts/analysis.py COMMAND [ARGS]...
    25	
    26	Table and plot generation for analysis
    27	
    28	╭─ Commands ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
    29	│ plot-radars               (RQ3) Generate radar charts for performance comparison between models                               │
    30	│ plot-set-relationships    (RQ2) Generate plots for TPs predicted by baseline model only vs cuf model only                     │
    31	│ table-actionable          (Toward More Actionable Guidance) Tabulate the results of the actionable features                   │
    32	│ table-performances        (RQ3) Generate table for performance comparison between models                                      │
    33	│ table-set-relationships   (RQ2) Generate table for TPs predicted by baseline model only vs cuf model only                     │
    34	╰───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
    35	```
